      "label": "Anthropomorphic pet behavior trope",
      "description": "The meme relies on the cultural trope of anthropomorphizing pets, attributing human-like motivations, emotions, and social roles (e.g., parental guidance, obedience, anxiety about authority figures) to animals. This trope is widely understood in popular culture and is central to the humor and relatability of the meme.",
