      "description": "The user is projected onto the puppy in the meme, as the text 'hurry up son' anthropomorphizes the adult dog's command, making the viewer identify with the puppy's role as the obedient child being called to action by the parent figure (the adult dog). The user sees themselves as the 'son' in this familial dynamic, responding to the implied authority of the owner (who is coming).",
